---
---
<section class="w-full bg-white py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 text-center">
    <h3 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
      Gamified Structure
    </h3>

    <p class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-lg text-slate-600 md:text-xl lg:text-2xl md:pt-12">
      Is the functional model that serves as a reference for Organization and
      the Game.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- Organization -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6">
        <svg
          class="mb-6 h-16 w-16 sm:h-20 sm:w-20 lg:h-24 lg:w-24 text-neutral-900"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"
        >
          <path d="M3 21h18" />
          <path d="M6 21V7l6-4 6 4v14" />
          <path d="M9 21v-6h6v6" />
        </svg>

        <h4 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold lg:text-2xl">
          Organization
        </h4>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-500 lg:text-lg">
          Is the operating system to create gamified environments. This framework
          applies to any type of community, by building better incentive systems.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Game -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6">
        <svg
          class="mb-6 h-16 w-16 sm:h-20 sm:w-20 lg:h-24 lg:w-24 text-neutral-900"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"
        >
          <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" />
          <path d="M9 12h6" />
          <path d="M12 9v6" />
        </svg>

        <h4 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold lg:text-2xl">
          Game
        </h4>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-500 lg:text-lg">
          Is the narrative projection, witch blend game elements with real-world
          operational models to work better while playing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
